        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The costs for the SCAF, Age Related Fee, and Service Related Fee apply until the retiree attains Medicare eligibility. Employees retiring on or after January 1, 2002, will be responsible for the SCFP until the end of the month in which their 75th birthday occurs. The retiree is not reimbursed for Medicare Part B.",
