        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees who are hired on or after January 1, 2001, and they retire from the Company, will be responsible for 50% of the cost of health care, based on coverage category. They will also be responsible for any Service Related fees or Age Related fees and plan co-pays and deductibles. The retiree will be responsible for 50% of the cost of health care as long as the retiree opts for coverage. The Service Related fees and Age Related fees apply until the retiree attains Medicare eligibility.",
            "block_bbox": [
                142,
